---
title: Organization
description: Your organization's details, and how to delete it.
---

Your organization's details are under **Settings → Details**. Only admins can change them.

- **Name** of the organization.
- **Legal form**: chosen when you create the organization. It can't be changed afterwards.
- **Address**: printed on your invoices and needed for QR-bills, so fill it in completely.
- **Communication**: **Language**, **Email**, **Phone** and **Website**. The language is used for your invoices when a client has none.

## Delete the organization

Admins find **Delete organization** at the bottom of the details page.

The organization becomes read-only right away: everyone can still look, nobody can change anything. After 30 days, it's deleted for good with all its data.

{% aside type="caution" %}This can't be undone.{% /aside %}
